; The padding transaction is dated on the pad, as in beancount: it is sized from the
; balance at the assertion it serves, and the balances between the pad and that
; assertion include it, so the assertion on the pad account between them holds.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 open Assets:A
1970-01-01 open Equity:Open
1970-01-01 open Expenses:Food

2024-01-01 pad Assets:A Equity:Open

2024-01-10 * "shop" "lunch"
  Assets:A  -30 CNY
  Expenses:Food

2024-01-15 balance Equity:Open  -100 CNY
2024-01-20 balance Assets:A  70 CNY
